asty":"宋"}},{"title":"村舍七首 其六","author":"陆游","text":"故絮五更偏觉冷，薄糜未午已先饥。\n谁知人不堪忧处，正是降魔奏凯时。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":5135,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"杨庭秀寄南海集二首 其二","author":"陆游","text":"飞卿数阕峤南曲，不许刘郎誇竹枝。\n四百年来无复继，如今始有此翁诗。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":5136,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"杨庭秀寄南海集二首 其一","author":"陆游","text":"俗子与人隔尘劫，何啻相逢风马牛。\n夜读杨卿南海句，始知天下有高流。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":5137,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"求月桂","author":"陆游","text":"重重汗简拥衰翁，百里家山梦不通。\n病眼可令常寂寞，烦君为致数枝红。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":5138,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"沈园二首 其一","author":"陆游","text":"城上斜阳画角哀，沈园非复旧池台。\n伤心桥下春波绿，曾是惊鸿照影来。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":5139,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"沈园二首 其二","author":"陆游","text":"梦断香消四十年，沈园柳老不吹绵。\n此身行作稽山土，犹吊遗踪一泫然。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":5140,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"泛舟","author":"陆游","text":"山照澄波䰀鬌青，新蒲梢上立蜻蜓。\n孤舟